  "headline": "Metoprolol succinate is not on FDA's shortage list; Teva posted a discontinuation on 2026-08-31 and our sites hold 18.7 to 28.5 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D5", "D24", "D1", "D2", "D3", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows metoprolol succinate is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Teva Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc. posted a discontinuation for metoprolol succinate extended-release tablets on 2026-08-31, citing a business decision to discontinue manufacture.",
      "cites": ["D24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 161 tablets of the 25 mg presentation at 8.6 tablets per day, providing 18.7 days on hand, and also holds 264 tablets at 13.6 per day for 19.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 393 tablets at 13.8 per day for 28.5 days on hand, and 305 tablets at 13.7 per day for 22.3 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is to buy from Actavis Pharma, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Secondary options include Advagen Pharma Limited and Advagen Pharma Ltd., also not on the shortage list, with no plant identified on their labels.",
      "cites": ["D7", "D8"]
    }
  ]
}
